tweets.text:
Something is being launched soon; what it is exactly very few know.

@Tesla had a handful of influencers visit GigaTexas today for an undisclosed purpose.

Chatter within the community says it is either a new affordable vehicle model, Full Self-Driving V14 or Optimus cooking BBQ.

tweets.text_zh:
即将推出一些东西；它究竟是什么，很少有人知道。

@Tesla 今天有一些有影响力的人出于未公开的目的访问了 GigaTexas。

社区内的议论称，它要么是一款新的经济实惠的车型，要么是全自动驾驶 V14，要么是 Optimus 烹饪烧烤。
